gpu-unlock (2.1.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add GA107 and the reported GA106 and AD106 laptop SKUs.
  * Pad Booter DMEM sizes to the Falcon DMA granularity.
  * Build on kernels older than 5.16, which have no pci_dev_lock().
  * Rebuild dracut initramfs images when installing the deb package, and
    load gpu_unlock ahead of nvidia by naming the dracut drop-in
    00-gpu-unlock.conf.
  * Add tools/bench_gemm.c.

